# Tolsimir, Midnight's Light: "if Tolsimir attacked this combat" is asked again as the trigger resolves (CR 603.4) and is about what happened,
# not what is on the battlefield: Tolsimir attacked with Voja Fenstalker on turn 3, and Bot2 answers the trigger by Bolting him (2 toughness),
# so he has left combat and the battlefield by the time it resolves. He did attack this combat, so Bot2's Young Wolf still must block Voja
# (CR 509.1c): it dies to the 5/5, which tramples 4 over (CR 702.19b), and returns with a +1/+1 counter (undying).

